    "title": "Junior Plant Manager at Netafim India Global Group",
    "description": "Are you a skilled Plant Manager looking for your next big career move? Netafim India Global Group in Surat offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Netafim India Global Group:\nNetafim India Global Group is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Statistical Process Control\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Learning & development budget\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Surat, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Netafim India Global Group!",
